</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7be26464-916d-11f1-84dd-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-31T154814Z-12785806-RC23PMAUJ1LJ-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7be26464-916d-11f1-84dd-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-31T154814Z-12785806-RC23PMAUJ1LJ-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2cb4c10e-91d9-11f1-ba42-5d53ccf8e6a7</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 20:55:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7be26464-916d-11f1-84dd-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-31T154814Z-12785806-RC23PMAUJ1LJ-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg">© Daniel Heuer / Facebook</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>美洲</category><title>美对由中国主导的芯片和太阳能加征关税</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2/20260806-%E7%BE%8E%E5%AF%B9%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%BB%E5%AF%BC%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%BE%81%E5%85%B3%E7%A8%8E</link><description>
